This installs a decompiled, open-source reconstruction of the Ultima V: Warriors of Destiny engine. It does not include the original game data.\par
\par
You will need your own legally obtained copy of Ultima V (BRIT.DAT, DATA.OVL, TILES.16, INIT.GAM and the rest of the game files). The first time you run the program, it will ask you to choose the folder containing those files.\par
\par
This software is a fan-made decompilation project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original publisher.\par
